<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse shut on Tuesday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse shut on Tuesday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange said in a statement on Monday that its trading hall will remain closed on Tuesday for a local religious holiday.</p>
<p>The bourse will resume trading on Wednesday, it said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
